/**
 * Timeline and widget-chrome string catalog: blocks, renderers, tool lists, selection, the
 * status line, memory groups, package provenance, and the Widget Library/Lab surfaces.
 *
 * Split out of `messages.ts` (rather than added to it directly) so two agents translating
 * different areas of the UI in parallel do not edit the same file. `messages.ts` imports and
 * spreads both objects into one locale each; `MessageKey` is still derived from the merged
 * `MESSAGES_VI`, so a key declared only here is exactly as typo-proof as one declared there.
 */

